    "oa:TextQuoteSelector"
   ],
   "oa:exact": "One correction, the same day, and it overrides the sentence above wherever\nthe two conflict: that direction covers work, never decisions. Every\ndecision — what to adopt, what to publish, what to spend, what to delete —\nneeds my own approval, asked for one at a time.",
   "oa:prefix": "— without asking me\neach time.\n\n"
